      "text": "In 2016, the United Nations' International Maritime Organization formally adopted IMO 2020, a regulation capping the sulfur content of fuel oil used in shipping at 0.5% by 2020."
    },
    {
      "attribution": "Court",
      "case_id": "2023-22-1165",
      "confidence": 1.0,
      "document_hash": "c8cc13e913d926a24e1639c705a3508366e48e8173c76d11250b085e12fcc9ca",
      "evidence_id": "ev-c8cc13e913d9-0000-0001",
      "kind": "fact",
      "opinion_part": null,
      "pages": {
        "end": 2,
        "start": 2
      },
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "Petitioner Macquarie Infrastructure Corporation owns a subsidiary that operates terminals to store bulk liquid commodities, including No. 6 fuel oil, a byproduct of the refning process with a typical sulfur content close to 3%."
    },
    {
      "attribution": "Court",
      "case_id": "2023-22-1165",
      "confidence": 1.0,
      "document_hash": "c8cc13e913d926a24e1639c705a3508366e48e8173c76d11250b085e12fcc9ca",
      "evidence_id": "ev-c8cc13e913d9-0000-0002",
